NOTE ON THE CONTENTS OF results/

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository. The prediction
dumps under results/ additionally contain reference building-height and
building-footprint values for the 207,579 test cells, which are derived from
the SHAFTS product (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.6370003) and remain subject
to the terms of that record. If you redistribute those files, retain the SHAFTS
attribution given in the README. No SHAFTS raster, tile or other georeferenced
product is redistributed here: the values are an unordered per-cell vector with
no coordinates attached.
